  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Education Programme III (SEP III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Syria Education Programme III (SEP III) aims to strengthen the Syrian education system and promote quality, inclusive primary education across Syria by providing technical assistance to the Ministry of Education and local Education Directorates on key areas. It will also provide urgent, short-term support to enable marginalised students and returnees to stay in education and re-integrate into the Syrian school system.</narrative>
  </description>
